{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbFWOX4EliabUtxLRPb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to build out a Furniro-style furniture store design in Figma: load Poppins fonts, then build a component library in the workspace page (header, footer, buttons, product card, badges, pagination, breadcrumb, page title), reusing the media components on page 13:9 etc. as instances with image fills, then build 9 screens and wire a prototype.\n\nI check the fonts first. Poppins Medium 16 already exists on a node, so the family is likely loaded; I load Poppins Light, Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Bold for safety before creating any text.\n\nI set the design system: brand gold #B88E2F, text primary #1A1A1F, secondary #6B6B70, muted #9F9F9F, background white, section tint #F9F1E7, alt strip #FAF3EA, border #E5E5E5, badge sale #E97171, badge new #2EC1AC. Type scale is display 44/56 SemiBold, h1 34/46 SemiBold, h2 28/40 SemiBold, h3 20/28 SemiBold, body 16/26 Regular, small 14/22 Regular, caption 12/18 Regular, eyebrow 12/18 Medium letterSpacing 2. Buttons keep corner radius 0 to match the given Button's default state.\n\nI create paint and text styles for these, then a \"Components\" frame at (-2200, 0), 2200 wide, holding a title plus Button variants (Primary gold fill white text, Outline gold border, Dark), Badge (Sale/New, 48x48 circle), and a SectionTitle with centered title and subtitle. Screens go at x=0 stacked vertically: 01 at (0,0), 02 at (0,1100), and so on with 80 gap.\n\nFor photos I use const inst = comp.createInstance(); then set inst.fills = [{type:'IMAGE', imageHash: comp.fills[0].imageHash, scaleMode:'FILL'}] so the image crops to the frame size without touching page 13:9.\n\nThe result: fonts load, tokens exist as styles, and the first atoms (Button, Badge, SectionTitle) sit in the library frame.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1957,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":41054,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1957}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"22a63f90-ed9d-4d33-847e-83aa25666b66","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:14:22.053Z","thinking_duration_ms":44702}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbFWOX4EliabUtxLRPb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private → Next: load Poppins and create the shared styles plus the core atom components (button variants, badges, section title) in the workspace. Everything below that — header, footer, product card, then the nine screens — depends on those existing, so this chunk comes first."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1957,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":41054,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1957}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"97514708-8bbb-4de2-8b88-330a879c6b0e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:14:23.506Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbFWOX4EliabUtxLRPb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XkwEycORyYDW1V36NqTPar","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='15:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst fonts = [\n {family:'Poppins',style:'Light'},{family:'Poppins',style:'Regular'},{family:'Poppins',style:'Medium'},\n {family:'Poppins',style:'SemiBold'},{family:'Poppins',style:'Bold'},{family:'Poppins',style:'ExtraBold'}\n];\nfor (const f of fonts) await figma.loadFontAsync(f);\n\nconst hex = h => { h=h.replace('#',''); return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255}; };\nconst solid = (h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o});\nconst C = {gold:'#B88E2F', ink:'#1A1A1F', body:'#4B4B52', muted:'#9F9F9F', line:'#E7E3DD',\n cream:'#F9F1E7', soft:'#FAF3EA', sale:'#E97171', fresh:'#2EC1AC', star:'#E3A324'};\n\nconst paints = {brand:'#B88E2F','text/ink':'#1A1A1F','text/body':'#4B4B52','text/muted':'#9F9F9F',\n 'surface/white':'#FFFFFF','surface/cream':'#F9F1E7','surface/soft':'#FAF3EA','border/line':'#E7E3DD',\n 'badge/sale':'#E97171','badge/new':'#2EC1AC','rating/star':'#E3A324'};\nfor (const [name,h] of Object.entries(paints)) {\n  const s = figma.createPaintStyle(); s.name='Furniro/'+name; s.paints=[solid(h)];\n}\n\nconst mkText = (name, style, size, lh, ls=0) => { const s = figma.createTextStyle(); s.name='Furniro/'+name;\n  s.fontName={family:'Poppins',style}; s.fontSize=size; s.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:lh}; s.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:ls}; return s; };\nmkText('Display/44', 'SemiBold', 44, 56);\nmkText('H1/34','SemiBold',34,46);\nmkText('H2/28','SemiBold',28,40);\nmkText('H3/20','SemiBold',20,28);\nmkText('Body/16','Regular',16,26);\nmkText('Body Strong/16','Medium',16,26);\nmkText('Small/14','Regular',14,22);\nmkText('Small Strong/14','Medium',14,22);\nmkText('Caption/12','Regular',12,18);\nmkText('Eyebrow/12','Medium',12,18,2.4);\n\nconst lib = figma.createFrame();\nlib.name='Furniro · Component Library';\nlib.x=-2400; lib.y=0; lib.resize(1900, 2200); lib.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')];\nconst libTitle = figma.createText(); libTitle.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'SemiBold'}; libTitle.fontSize=28;\nlibTitle.characters='Furniro — Components'; libTitle.x=40; libTitle.y=32; libTitle.fills=[solid(C.ink)]; lib.appendChild(libTitle);\nconst libSub = figma.createText(); libSub.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Regular'}; libSub.fontSize=14;\nlibSub.characters='Built for 03 · Workspace. Sections are grouped by role: atoms, header/footer, commerce, forms.'; libSub.x=40; libSub.y=72; libSub.fills=[solid(C.body)]; lib.appendChild(libSub);\n\n// ---- helpers ----\nconst txt = (chars, size, style, color, opts={}) => {\n  const t = figma.createText();\n  t.fontName={family:'Poppins',style}; t.characters=chars;\n  t.fontSize=size; t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:opts.lh || Math.round(size*1.5)};\n  if (opts.ls) t.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:opts.ls};\n  t.fills=[solid(color)];\n  if (opts.align) t.textAlignHorizontal=opts.align;\n  if (opts.w) { t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(opts.w, t.height); }\n  return t;\n};\n\n// ---- Button component set ----\nconst btnDefs = [\n {style:'Primary', bg:C.gold, fg:'#FFFFFF', border:null},\n {style:'Outline', bg:null, fg:C.gold, border:C.gold},\n {style:'Dark', bg:C.ink, fg:'#FFFFFF', border:null}\n];\nconst btnComps = [];\nfor (const d of btnDefs) {\n  const c = figma.createComponent(); c.name='Style='+d.style;\n  c.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; c.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  c.paddingLeft=36; c.paddingRight=36; c.paddingTop=16; c.paddingBottom=16;\n  c.cornerRadius=0; c.fills = d.bg ? [solid(d.bg)] : [];\n  if (d.border) { c.strokes=[solid(d.border)]; c.strokeWeight=1; c.strokeAlign='INSIDE'; }\n  const label = txt('BUY NOW', 16, 'Medium', d.fg, {lh:24, ls:1.2});\n  label.name='Label'; c.appendChild(label);\n  c.x=40; c.y=140; lib.appendChild(c); btnComps.push(c);\n}\nconst btnSet = figma.combineAsVariants(btnComps, lib);\nbtnSet.name='Button'; btnSet.x=40; btnSet.y=140;\nbtnSet.paddingLeft=0; btnSet.paddingTop=0;\n\n// ---- Badge ----\nconst badgeDefs = [{t:'Sale',bg:C.sale,label:'-30%'},{t:'New',bg:C.fresh,label:'New'}];\nconst badges=[];\nfor (const b of badgeDefs) {\n  const c = figma.createComponent(); c.name='Type='+b.t;\n  c.resize(48,48); c.cornerRadius=48; c.fills=[solid(b.bg)];\n  c.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; c.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; c.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\n  const t = txt(b.label,14,'Medium','#FFFFFF',{lh:18}); t.name='Label'; c.appendChild(t);\n  lib.appendChild(c); badges.push(c);\n}\nconst badgeSet = figma.combineAsVariants(badges, lib);\nbadgeSet.name='Badge'; badgeSet.x=560; badgeSet.y=140;\n\n// ---- SectionTitle ----\nconst st = figma.createComponent(); st.name='SectionTitle';\nst.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; st.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; st.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER';\nst.itemSpacing=8; st.fills=[]; st.resize(600,120);\nconst stT = txt('Browse The Range',32,'SemiBold',C.ink,{lh:44,align:'CENTER'}); stT.name='Title'; stT.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; stT.resize(600,44);\nconst stS = txt('Find the right pieces for every room in your home.',16,'Regular',C.body,{lh:26,align:'CENTER'}); stS.name='Subtitle'; stS.resize(600,26);\nst.appendChild(stT); st.appendChild(stS);\nlib.appendChild(st); st.x=40; st.y=420;\n\nfigma.currentPage.selection=[];\nreturn {ok:true, buttonSet: btnSet.id, badge: badgeSet.id, sectionTitle: st.id, styles: figma.getLocalTextStyles().length, paints: figma.getLocalPaintStyles().length};","description":"Load Poppins, create color and text styles, button/badge/section-title components","fileKey":"23jRGXpKPbuVCf5vMPFJBR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":1957,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":41054,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1957}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"bef63418-9213-4b8e-811e-f91eb1334960","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:14:40.758Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XkwEycORyYDW1V36NqTPar","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
