{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbLS0vO3N3vT0XYx6po","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a reusable photo helper that builds image-filled frames from media imageHash, plus the site header, footer, feature strip and product card components built on the atoms. I build the photo helper first: it reads the imageHash from the media component and creates a local component frame named Photo_X with a FILL image fill, then instances it at the needed sizes with FILL crop.\n\nFor the header I use height 80, white background, content width 1240 centered with padding 100 at 1440. Logo 40x40 plus \"Furniro\" at 26 SemiBold ink. Nav gap 48, icons gap 36, and the current nav item gets gold color plus a 2px gold underline. Header variants for current: none/Home/Shop/Contact.\n\nThe footer uses #FAF3EA with padding 100 and columns: brand+address, Links, Help, Newsletter, plus a bottom copyright line with a top border. The feature strip shares #FAF3EA, with 4 items, gold icons at 52px, title 20 SemiBold, subtitle 16 body.\n\nThe product card is 285x445: photo 285x300 with a badge top-right, info area bg #F4F5F7 padding 16, name 24 SemiBold, description 16 muted, price row 20","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6844,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":43011,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6844}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"2f72a173-3ed6-45ab-b512-d4c03bf2e545","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:15:12.470Z","thinking_duration_ms":23139}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbLS0vO3N3vT0XYx6po","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private → Next: build the shared site chrome and commerce atoms in the library: local photo components from the media image fills, then the header (with current-item variants), feature strip, footer, and a product card with a hover state. Those all depend only on the atom work that already exists, so they can go in a single pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6844,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":43011,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6844}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"9f2b2c39-961e-42d2-af46-7b7e1fbadb76","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:15:14.393Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbLS0vO3N3vT0XYx6po","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0132ihH4H0qMr3sBNRWWo9xy","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='15:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Light','Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Poppins',style:s});\nconst hex = h => { h=h.replace('#',''); return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255}; };\nconst solid=(h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o});\nconst C={gold:'#B88E2F',ink:'#1A1A1F',body:'#4B4B52',muted:'#9F9F9F',line:'#E7E3DD',cream:'#F9F1E7',soft:'#FAF3EA',sale:'#E97171',fresh:'#2EC1AC'};\nconst lib = page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Furniro · Component Library');\n\n// ---------- local photo components from media ----------\nconst mediaPage = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='1:4');\nconst photoDefs = ['Photo_Hero','Photo_Page_Banner','Photo_Asgaard_Sofa','Photo_Cloud_Sofa_1','Photo_Cloud_Sofa_2','Photo_Maya_Sofa','Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set','Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set_Alt','Photo_Product_Grifo','Photo_Product_Leviosa','Photo_Product_Lolito','Photo_Product_Muggo','Photo_Product_Pingky','Photo_Product_Potty','Photo_Product_Respira','Photo_Product_Syltherine','Photo_Stuart_Sofa','Photo_Inspiration_2','Photo_Inspiration_3','Photo_Inspiration_Inner_Peace','Photo_Range_Bedroom','Photo_Range_Dining','Photo_Range_Living','Photo_Setup_1','Photo_Setup_2','Photo_Setup_3','Photo_Setup_4','Photo_Setup_5','Photo_Setup_6','Photo_Setup_7','Photo_Setup_8','Photo_Setup_9','Photo_Blog_1','Photo_Blog_2','Photo_Blog_3','Photo_Recent_1','Photo_Recent_2','Photo_Recent_3','Photo_Recent_4','Photo_Recent_5'];\nconst icons = ['Icon_Account','Icon_Arrow_Right','Icon_Calendar','Icon_Cart','Icon_Cart_Close','Icon_Chevron_Down','Icon_Chevron_Right','Icon_Clock','Icon_Compare','Icon_Delete','Icon_Filter','Icon_Grid','Icon_Guarantee','Icon_Heart','Icon_Location','Icon_Phone','Icon_Remove','Icon_Search','Icon_Share','Icon_Shipping','Icon_Star','Icon_Star_Half','Icon_Support','Icon_Tag','Icon_Trophy','Icon_User','Icon_View_List'];\nconst logos = ['Logo_Furniro','Logo_Facebook','Logo_LinkedIn','Logo_Twitter'];\nconst photoHash = {}, iconSrc = {}, logoHash = {};\nfunction scan(list, out, imgToo) {\n  for (const name of list) {\n    const node = mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name===name);\n    if (!node) continue;\n    if (node.fills && node.fills.length && node.fills[0].type==='IMAGE') {\n      const hash = node.fills[0].imageHash;\n      if (imgToo) { out[name]=hash; } \n      const kw = 'P_'+name;\n      let comp = lib.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name===kw);\n      if (!comp) { comp = figma.createComponent(); comp.name=kw; comp.resize(400,300); comp.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:hash,scaleMode:'FILL'}]; lib.appendChild(comp); comp.y=1900; comp.x=40 + (Object.keys(out).length*10); }\n      out[name] = {comp};\n    } else {\n      out[name]=node;\n    }\n  }\n}\n// create photo components (dedupe by name)\nconst photoComp = {};\nfor (const name of photoDefs) {\n  const node = mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name===name);\n  if (!node) continue;\n  let comp = lib.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name==='P_'+name);\n  if (!comp) {\n    comp = figma.createComponent(); comp.name='P_'+name; comp.resize(400,300);\n    comp.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:node.fills[0].imageHash,scaleMode:'FILL'}];\n    lib.appendChild(comp); comp.x=40; comp.y=1900;\n  }\n  photoComp[name]=comp;\n}\nconst collectIcons = (root) => { for (const n of icons) { const x = mediaPage.findOne(nn=>nn.type==='COMPONENT' && nn.name===n); if (x) iconSrc[n]=x; } };\ncollectIcons();\nconst logoSrc = mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name==='Logo_Furniro');\nconst fb = mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name==='Logo_Facebook');\nconst li = mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name==='Logo_LinkedIn');\nconst tw = mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT' && n.name==='Logo_Twitter');\n\nconst txt=(chars,size,style,color,o={})=>{const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Poppins',style};t.characters=chars;t.fontSize=size;t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh||Math.round(size*1.5)};if(o.ls)t.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.ls};t.fills=[solid(color)];if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(o.w,t.height);}return t;};\nconst photo=(name,x,y,w,h)=>{const inst=photoComp[name].createInstance();inst.name=name;inst.fills=[photoComp[name].fills[0]];inst.resize(w,h);inst.x=x;inst.y=y;return inst;};\nconst icon=(name,size,color)=>{const inst=iconSrc[name].createInstance();inst.name=name;inst.resize(size,size);if(color)inst.fills=[solid(color)];return inst;};\nconst iconAt=(parent,name,size,color,x,y)=>{const i=icon(name,size,color);i.x=x;i.y=y;parent.appendChild(i);return i;};\n\n// ---------- Header component set ----------\nconst navItems=['Home','Shop','About','Contact'];\nfunction buildHeader(current){\n  const h=figma.createComponent(); h.name='Current='+(current||'none');\n  h.resize(1440,80); h.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')]; h.layoutMode='NONE';\n  const divider=figma.createRectangle(); divider.resize(1440,1); divider.x=0; divider.y=79; divider.fills=[solid(C.line)]; divider.name='Divider'; h.appendChild(divider);\n  const logo=logoSrc.createInstance(); logo.name='Logo'; logo.resize(40,40); logo.x=100; logo.y=20; h.appendChild(logo);\n  const brand=txt('Furniro',26,'SemiBold',C.ink,{lh:32}); brand.name='Brand'; brand.x=150; brand.y=25; h.appendChild(brand);\n  let x=560;\n  for(const item of navItems){\n    const isCur=item===current;\n    const t=txt(item,16,isCur?'Medium':'Regular',isCur?C.gold:C.ink,{lh:24}); t.name='Nav_'+item; t.x=x; t.y=28;\n    h.appendChild(t);\n    if(isCur){ const bar=figma.createRectangle(); bar.name='Indicator_'+item; bar.resize(t.width,2); bar.x=x; bar.y=54; bar.fills=[solid(C.gold)]; h.appendChild(bar); }\n    x += t.width + (item==='Shop'?48:46);\n  }\n  const group=figma.createFrame(); group.name='Actions'; group.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; group.itemSpacing=40; group.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; group.fills=[]; group.resize(260,40);\n  const iconset=['Icon_Account','Icon_Search','Icon_Heart','Icon_Cart'];\n  const acts=iconset.map(n=>{const i=icon(n,26,C.ink);i.name=n;return i;});\n  acts.forEach(a=>group.appendChild(a));\n  group.x=1100; group.y=27; h.appendChild(group);\n  group.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG'; group.layoutSizingVertical='HUG';\n  h.x=40; h.y=0; lib.appendChild(h);\n  return h;\n}\nconst headers=['Home','Shop','Contact',null].map(buildHeader);\nconst headerSet=figma.combineAsVariants(headers,lib); headerSet.name='SiteHeader'; headerSet.x=40; headerSet.y=620;\n\n// ---------- Feature strip ----------\nconst feat=figma.createComponent(); feat.name='FeatureStrip'; feat.resize(1440,270); feat.fills=[solid(C.soft)];\nfeat.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; feat.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; feat.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; feat.itemSpacing=40; feat.paddingLeft=100; feat.paddingRight=100;\nconst featData=[['Icon_Trophy','High Quality','crafted from top materials'],['Icon_Guarantee','Warranty Protection','Over 2 years'],['Icon_Shipping','Free Shipping','Order over Rs. 150,000'],['Icon_Support','24 / 7 Support','Dedicated support']];\nfor(const [ic,title,sub] of featData){\n  const col=figma.createFrame(); col.name='Feature_'+title; col.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; col.itemSpacing=12; col.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; col.fills=[]; col.resize(300,80);\n  const icn=icon(ic,56,C.ink); icn.name='Icon'; col.appendChild(icn);\n  const colT=figma.createFrame(); colT.name='Copy'; colT.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; colT.itemSpacing=2; colT.fills=[]; colT.resize(210,60);\n  const t1=txt(title,19,'SemiBold',C.ink,{lh:28}); t1.name='Title'; const t2=txt(sub,15,'Regular',C.body,{lh:24}); t2.name='Sub';\n  colT.appendChild(t1); colT.appendChild(t2); col.appendChild(colT);\n  col.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG'; col.layoutSizingVertical='HUG'; colT.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\n  feat.appendChild(col);\n  col.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n}\nlib.appendChild(feat); feat.x=40; feat.y=1000;\n\n// ---------- Footer ----------\nconst footer=figma.createComponent(); footer.name='SiteFooter'; footer.resize(1440,410); footer.fills=[solid(C.soft)];\nfooter.layoutMode='NONE';\nconst top=figma.createRectangle(); top.resize(1240,1); top.x=100; top.y=0; top.fills=[solid('#E7DFD1')]; top.name='TopRule'; footer.appendChild(top);\nconst fb2=footer;\nconst brandCol=figma.createFrame(); brandCol.name='Brand'; brandCol.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; brandCol.itemSpacing=0; brandCol.fills=[]; brandCol.resize(300,80);\nconst ft1=txt('Furniro.',28,'Bold',C.ink,{lh:36}); ft1.name='Wordmark';\nconst addr=txt('400 University Drive Suite 200,\\nCoral Gables, FL 33134 USA',15,'Regular',C.body,{lh:24}); addr.name='Address';\nbrandCol.appendChild(ft1); brandCol.appendChild(addr);\nbrandCol.x=100; brandCol.y=72; footer.appendChild(brandCol);\n\nconst mkLinkCol=(name,x,heading,items)=>{const col=figma.createFrame();col.name=name;col.layoutMode='VERTICAL';col.itemSpacing=16;col.fills=[];col.resize(140,220);\n const hd=txt(heading,16,'Medium',C.muted,{lh:24}); hd.name='Heading'; col.appendChild(hd);\n for(const it of items){const t=txt(it,16,'Medium',C.ink,{lh:24}); t.name='Link_'+it; col.appendChild(t);}\n col.x=x; col.y=72; footer.appendChild(col); return col;};\nmkLinkCol('Links',560,'Links',['Home','Shop','About','Contact']);\nmkLinkCol('Help',760,'Help',['Payment Options','Returns','Privacy Policies']);\nconst newsCol=figma.createFrame(); newsCol.name='Newsletter'; newsCol.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; newsCol.itemSpacing=26; newsCol.fills=[]; newsCol.resize(330,160);\nconst nh=txt('Newsletter',16,'Medium',C.muted,{lh:24}); nh.name='Heading'; newsCol.appendChild(nh);\nconst row=figma.createFrame(); row.name='SubscribeRow'; row.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; row.itemSpacing=14; row.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; row.fills=[]; row.resize(330,36);\nconst email=txt('Enter Your Email Address',14,'Regular',C.muted,{lh:20}); email.name='EmailField';\nconst sub=txt('SUBSCRIBE',14,'SemiBold',C.ink,{lh:20,ls:0.6}); sub.name='Subscribe';\nconst underline=figma.createRectangle(); underline.resize(96,1); underline.y=22; underline.fills=[solid(C.ink)]; underline.name='Underline';\nconst subWrap=figma.createFrame(); subWrap.name='SubscribeWrap'; subWrap.layoutMode='NONE'; subWrap.resize(96,26); subWrap.fills=[]; subWrap.appendChild(sub); sub.appendChild(underline);\nrow.appendChild(email); row.appendChild(subWrap); row.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\nnewsCol.appendChild(row); newsCol.x=980; newsCol.y=72; footer.appendChild(newsCol);\nconst rule=figma.createRectangle(); rule.resize(1240,1); rule.x=100; rule.y=330; rule.fills=[solid('#E7DFD1')]; rule.name='BottomRule'; footer.appendChild(rule);\nconst copy=txt('2023 Furniro. All rights reserved',16,'Regular',C.ink,{lh:24}); copy.name='Copyright'; copy.x=100; copy.y=356; footer.appendChild(copy);\nlib.appendChild(footer); footer.x=40; footer.y=1340;\n\n// ---------- Product card ----------\nconst btnSet = lib.findOne(n=>n.name==='Button');\nconst badgeSet = lib.findOne(n=>n.name==='Badge');\nfunction buildCard(state){\n  const card=figma.createComponent(); card.name='State='+state; card.resize(285,450); card.fills=[solid('#F4F5F7')]; card.layoutMode='NONE'; card.cornerRadius=0;\n  const ph=photo('Photo_Product_Syltherine',0,0,285,300); ph.name='Photo'; card.appendChild(ph);\n  const info=figma.createFrame(); info.name='Info'; info.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; info.itemSpacing=6; info.fills=[solid('#F4F5F7')]; info.paddingLeft=16;info.paddingRight=16;info.paddingTop=16;info.paddingBottom=20; info.resize(285,150); info.x=0; info.y=300;\n  const nm=txt('Syltherine',24,'SemiBold',C.ink,{lh:32}); nm.name='Name';\n  const ds=txt('Stylish cafe chair',16,'Regular',C.muted,{lh:24}); ds.name='Desc';\n  const pr=txt('Rs. 2,500,000.00',20,'SemiBold',C.ink,{lh:28}); pr.name='Price';\n  const old=txt('Rs. 3,500,000.00',15,'Regular',C.muted,{lh:22}); old.name='OldPrice';\n  const strike=figma.createRectangle(); strike.resize(118,1); strike.fills=[solid(C.muted)]; strike.name='Strike';\n  const priceRow=figma.createFrame(); priceRow.name='PriceRow'; priceRow.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; priceRow.itemSpacing=12; priceRow.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; priceRow.fills=[]; priceRow.resize(240,28);\n  priceRow.appendChild(pr); priceRow.appendChild(old);\n  priceRow.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\n  old.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n  info.appendChild(nm); info.appendChild(ds); info.appendChild(priceRow);\n  card.appendChild(info);\n  const badgeInst=badgeSet.defaultVariant.createInstance(); badgeInst.name='Badge'; badgeInst.x=213; badgeInst.y=24; card.appendChild(badgeInst);\n  if(state==='Hover'){\n    const ov=figma.createFrame(); ov.name='HoverOverlay'; ov.resize(285,300); ov.fills=[solid('#3A3A3A',0.72)]; ov.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; ov.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; ov.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; ov.itemSpacing=24; ov.x=0; ov.y=0;\n    const addBtn=btnSet.defaultVariant.createInstance(); addBtn.name='AddToCart';\n    const lbl=addBtn.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); if(lbl){lbl.characters='Add to cart';}\n    addBtn.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')]; if(lbl) lbl.fills=[solid(C.gold)];\n    addBtn.paddingLeft=24; addBtn.paddingRight=24; addBtn.paddingTop=12; addBtn.paddingBottom=12;\n    const shareIc=txt('Share',15,'SemiBold','#FFFFFF',{lh:22}); const cmpIc=txt('Compare',15,'SemiBold','#FFFFFF',{lh:22}); const likeIc=txt('Like',15,'SemiBold','#FFFFFF',{lh:22});\n    const icRow=figma.createFrame(); icRow.name='Actions'; icRow.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; icRow.itemSpacing=24; icRow.fills=[]; icRow.resize(240,26);\n    for(const [n,labelTxt] of [['Icon_Share',shareIc],['Icon_Compare',cmpIc],['Icon_Heart',likeIc]]){\n      const wrap=figma.createFrame(); wrap.name=n; wrap.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; wrap.itemSpacing=6; wrap.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; wrap.fills=[]; wrap.resize(90,26);\n      const ic=icon(n,16,'#FFFFFF'); ic.name=n+'_i'; wrap.appendChild(ic); wrap.appendChild(labelTxt); wrap.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\n      icRow.appendChild(wrap);\n    }\n    icRow.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\n    ov.appendChild(addBtn); ov.appendChild(icRow);\n    card.appendChild(ov);\n  }\n  card.x=40; card.y=varY; lib.appendChild(card);\n  return card;\n}\nlet varY=1800;\nconst cardDefault=buildCard('Default'); varY+=500;\nconst cardHover=buildCard('Hover');\nconst cardSet=figma.combineAsVariants([cardDefault,cardHover],lib); cardSet.name='ProductCard'; cardSet.x=900; cardSet.y=1000;\n\nfigma.currentPage.selection=[];\nreturn {headerSet:headerSet.id, feature:feat.id, footer:footer.id, cardSet:cardSet.id, photos:Object.keys(photoComp).length};","description":"Build photo components, header variants, feature strip, footer, product card variants","fileKey":"23jRGXpKPbuVCf5vMPFJBR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6844,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":43011,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6844}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"07de2127-b123-49d4-bc49-071a729b07c5","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:15:58.429Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0132ihH4H0qMr3sBNRWWo9xy","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
