{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbtKuQMH4Qr5qYg9PBD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why the header tint fix still shows black squares despite the repair setting fills to [] on the instance root and its descendants. I see the screenshot is unchanged from before, which means the change never landed. The header repair ran successfully in the failing script, but the script then errored later at the feature strip. In the Figma plugin API, an error rolls back the whole script's changes, so the header fix was discarded while the feature strip rebuild in the third script applied and stayed. The feature strip icons render fine with the same approach, which confirms the approach itself works; the header simply needs the tint re-applied. The product card hover icons look fine in white.\n\nI set out the next build steps: shared components first (breadcrumb/page banner header, pagination, toolbar), then the 9 screens, using a screen-builder script with helper functions and instances of the header, footer, and feature strip. Content width is 1240 with margins of 100. The screens are 01_Home (~4200 tall), 02_Shop, 03_Product, 04_Cart_Drawer (frame 1440x1200, drawer x=940 w=500), 05_Comparison, 06_Cart, 07_Checkout, 08_Contact, 09_Blog. The feature strip appears on 02 and 05–09, not on 03 and 04. I plan to build in chunks: fix the header icons, create the banner, pagination, and form field components, then build screens individually with self-contained helpers.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2392,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":82281,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2392}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"a3dff86e-e370-4b02-ab00-d473054da508","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:22:16.077Z","thinking_duration_ms":33495}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbtKuQMH4Qr5qYg9PBD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The header icon tints were rolled back when that earlier script errored, so the squares are back. Private list: (1) re-tint header icons and verify the header renders, (2) build the remaining shared pieces — page banner with breadcrumb, pagination, tabs, quantity stepper, form field, toolbar — in the library. The banner depends on photo components that exist, so I can do the tint and the new components in one script."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2392,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":82281,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2392}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"758ca64a-ac38-42f4-bcbd-7fd0fba367c3","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:22:18.593Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNbtKuQMH4Qr5qYg9PBD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01cpgoUCt60yQf0w5IIk8pGf","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='15:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Light','Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Poppins',style:s});\nconst hex=h=>{h=h.replace('#','');return{r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};};\nconst solid=(h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o});\nconst C={gold:'#B88E2F',ink:'#1A1A1F',body:'#4B4B52',muted:'#9F9F9F',line:'#E7E3DD',cream:'#F9F1E7',soft:'#FAF3EA'};\nconst lib=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Furniro · Component Library');\nconst mediaPage=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='1:4');\nfunction tint(n,col){ n.fills=[]; const deep=(x)=>{ if('fills' in x && x.fills && ['VECTOR','ELLIPSE','RECTANGLE','POLYGON','BOOLEAN_OPERATION'].includes(x.type)) x.fills=[solid(col)]; if('children' in x) x.children.forEach(deep); }; deep(n); }\nfunction fixIcons(root,col){ let c=0; (function walk(n){ if(n.type==='INSTANCE' && n.mainComponent && n.mainComponent.name.startsWith('Icon_')){ tint(n,col); c++; } if('children' in n) n.children.forEach(walk); })(root); return c; }\nconst hdr=lib.findOne(n=>n.name==='SiteHeader');\nconst tinted=fixIcons(hdr,C.ink);\n\n// ---------- Page banner + breadcrumb component ----------\nconst pb=figma.createComponent(); pb.name='PageBanner'; pb.resize(1440,316); pb.fills=[]; pb.layoutMode='NONE';\nconst bannerSrc=mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Photo_Page_Banner');\nconst bg=figma.createFrame(); bg.name='Photo'; bg.resize(1440,316); bg.x=0; bg.y=0;\nbg.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:bannerSrc.fills[0].imageHash,scaleMode:'FILL'}];\nbg.clipsContent=true;\nconst overlay=figma.createRectangle(); overlay.name='Scrim'; overlay.resize(1440,316); overlay.fills=[solid('#1A1A1F',0.35)]; bg.appendChild(overlay);\nconst logoB=mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Logo_Furniro');\nconst lg=logoB.createInstance(); lg.name='Logo'; lg.resize(48,48); lg.x=796; lg.y=78; bg.appendChild(lg);\nconst title=figma.createText(); title.name='Title'; title.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Medium'}; title.characters='Shop'; title.fontSize=48; title.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:62}; title.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')]; title.x=0; title.y=132; title.resize(1440,62); title.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER';\nbg.appendChild(title);\nconst crumbWrap=figma.createFrame(); crumbWrap.name='Breadcrumb'; crumbWrap.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; crumbWrap.itemSpacing=8; crumbWrap.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; crumbWrap.fills=[]; crumbWrap.resize(300,24); crumbWrap.x=0; crumbWrap.y=214;\nconst cr1=figma.createText(); cr1.name='Home'; cr1.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Medium'}; cr1.characters='Home'; cr1.fontSize=16; cr1.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')];\nconst chvS=mediaPage.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Icon_Chevron_Right');\nconst chv=chvS.createInstance(); chv.name='Chevron'; chv.resize(16,16); tint(chv,'#FFFFFF');\nconst cr2=figma.createText(); cr2.name='Current'; cr2.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Light'}; cr2.characters='Shop'; cr2.fontSize=16; cr2.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')];\ncrumbWrap.appendChild(cr1); crumbWrap.appendChild(chv); crumbWrap.appendChild(cr2);\ncrumbWrap.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\nbg.appendChild(crumbWrap);\npb.appendChild(bg); pb.x=40; pb.y=1700; lib.appendChild(pb);\n\n// ---------- Pagination ----------\nconst pag=figma.createComponent(); pag.name='Pagination'; pag.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; pag.itemSpacing=16; pag.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; pag.fills=[];\nfor(const [label,state] of [['1','Current'],['2','Idle'],['3','Idle'],['Next','Next']]){\n  const b=figma.createFrame(); b.name='Page_'+label; b.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; b.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; b.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; b.itemSpacing=8;\n  b.resize(label==='Next'?70:52,52); b.cornerRadius=10;\n  b.fills=[solid(state==='Current'?C.gold:'#F9F1E7')];\n  const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Regular'}; t.characters=label; t.fontSize=16; t.fills=[solid(state==='Current'?'#FFFFFF':C.ink)];\n  b.appendChild(t); b.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG'; b.layoutSizingVertical='HUG';\n  b.paddingLeft=20; b.paddingRight=20; b.paddingTop=14; b.paddingBottom=14;\n  pag.appendChild(b);\n}\npag.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG'; pag.layoutSizingVertical='HUG';\npag.x=40; pag.y=2100; lib.appendChild(pag);\n\n// ---------- Quantity stepper ----------\nconst qty=figma.createComponent(); qty.name='QtyStepper'; qty.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; qty.itemSpacing=0; qty.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; qty.fills=[]; qty.resize(150,52);\nqty.strokes=[solid('#9F9F9F')]; qty.strokeWeight=1; qty.cornerRadius=10;\nfor(const [l,mark] of [['−','minus'],['1','value'],['+','plus']]){\n  const w=figma.createFrame(); w.name='Qty_'+mark; w.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; w.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; w.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; w.fills=[]; w.resize(50,52);\n  const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Regular'}; t.characters=l; t.fontSize=18; t.fills=[solid(C.ink)];\n  w.appendChild(t); qty.appendChild(w);\n}\nqty.x=40; qty.y=2220; lib.appendChild(qty);\n\n// ---------- Tabs ----------\nconst tabs=figma.createComponent(); tabs.name='Tabs'; tabs.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; tabs.itemSpacing=52; tabs.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; tabs.fills=[]; tabs.resize(560,50);\nconst tabData=[['Description','Current'],['Additional Information','Idle'],['Reviews [204]','Idle']];\nfor(const [label,state] of tabData){\n  const wrap=figma.createFrame(); wrap.name='Tab_'+label; wrap.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; wrap.itemSpacing=8; wrap.fills=[]; wrap.resize(120,50);\n  const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:state==='Current'?'Medium':'Regular'}; t.characters=label; t.fontSize=24; t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:34}; t.fills=[solid(state==='Current'?C.ink:'#9F9F9F')];\n  wrap.appendChild(t); wrap.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\n  if(state==='Current'){ const bar=figma.createRectangle(); bar.resize(Math.round(t.width),2); bar.fills=[solid(C.ink)]; wrap.appendChild(bar); }\n  tabs.appendChild(wrap);\n}\ntabs.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG'; tabs.layoutSizingVertical='HUG';\ntabs.x=40; tabs.y=2340; lib.appendChild(tabs);\n\n// ---------- Form field ----------\nconst ff=figma.createComponent(); ff.name='FormField'; ff.layoutMode='VERTICAL'; ff.itemSpacing=22; ff.fills=[]; ff.resize(453,110);\nconst lbl=figma.createText(); lbl.name='Label'; lbl.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Medium'}; lbl.characters='First Name'; lbl.fontSize=16; lbl.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:24}; lbl.fills=[solid(C.ink)];\nconst input=figma.createFrame(); input.name='Input'; input.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; input.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; input.paddingLeft=24; input.paddingRight=24; input.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')]; input.strokes=[solid('#9F9F9F')]; input.strokeWeight=1; input.cornerRadius=10; input.resize(453,58);\nconst ph=figma.createText(); ph.name='Placeholder'; ph.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Regular'}; ph.characters='Abc'; ph.fontSize=16; ph.fills=[solid('#9F9F9F')];\ninput.appendChild(ph);\nff.appendChild(lbl); ff.appendChild(input);\nff.x=40; ff.y=2460; lib.appendChild(ff);\n\n// ---------- Toolbar chip ----------\nconst chip=figma.createComponent(); chip.name='ToolbarChip'; chip.layoutMode='HORIZONTAL'; chip.itemSpacing=10; chip.counterAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; chip.fills=[]; chip.resize(90,40);\nconst chipT=figma.createText(); chipT.fontName={family:'Poppins',style:'Regular'}; chipT.characters='Filter'; chipT.fontSize=18; chipT.fills=[solid(C.ink)];\nchip.appendChild(chipT); chip.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG'; chip.layoutSizingVertical='HUG';\nchip.x=580; chip.y=2100; lib.appendChild(chip);\n\n// ---------- AddToCart button for product/drawer ----------\nreturn {tinted, pb:pb.id, pag:pag.id, qty:qty.id, tabs:tabs.id, field:ff.id, chip:chip.id};","description":"Re-tint header icons and add banner, pagination, stepper, tabs, form field components","fileKey":"23jRGXpKPbuVCf5vMPFJBR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2392,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":82281,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2392}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"7dd38bf6-4352-4ee2-b256-b3b8735c098c","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:22:41.934Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01cpgoUCt60yQf0w5IIk8pGf","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
