{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNc0KBKE8C7EzY7U7BiW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for 9 screens built on the existing component library, with the banner breadcrumb centering fixed first. The library already has atoms, header, footer, feature strip, product card, banner, pagination, qty, tabs, form field and chip, and the workspace page has no screens yet, so the screens are the next real work.\n\nSpacing comes first. 01_Home sits at x=0, y=0 at 1440 wide: header 80 tall, hero 1440x620, browse-the-range tiles 380x480, a 4-column product grid at 292 card width with 24 gap, an inspiration band 1440x670 with the main photo at 420x486 and two thumbnails at 200x240, then the setup mosaic and footer, giving a total height of about 4650. 02_Shop goes at x=1520, y=0, and the screens continue left to right at 1520 pitch.\n\nThe breadcrumb fix is small: the breadcrumb row sits at x=0 of 1440, so I center it by hugging its content and setting x=(1440-width)/2 at y=214.\n\nThe card masters need normalizing before instancing: rename the photo instance, the 24 name, 16 desc, 18 price and 12 old-price texts, and the old-price wrapper, so every instance can be filled from data. Badges switch between -30% and New, and hide when a product has no badge. Leviosa shows the hover state on Home.\n\nThe only independent thing to check in parallel is fonts and a screenshot; everything else waits on these screens existing.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2080,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":92212,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2080}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"78f1a4d0-8aef-4387-a6d1-6b0ec1092f05","timestamp":"2026-11-