{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNcDlFMz6l8phVAVHsVi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking to fix the card internals naming, rebuild the broken 01_Home grid cards with robust targeting by type and text content, and then build 02_Shop. Naming isn't strictly needed since I target by type and text content, so I rewrite mkCard to find nodes by characters and structure, independent of names. The rename is still worth doing as a master edit before instancing. The badge override is tricky: setProperties may fail on a variant of the Badge set, so I find the Label text and set characters, and for the New badge I use instance.swapComponent to swap the mainComponent. I do the full fix and rebuild in one script, then screenshot. Height calc for 02_Shop: header 80 + banner 316 + toolbar 88 + 4 rows of 450 with 24 gaps = 1872, ending at 2432, then pagination at 2500, features at 2620, footer at 2890, total 3300. Cards sit at pitch 309, 285 wide, 4 per row, x=100, y start 560, 16 products.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2133,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":112204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2133}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"56e46a84-7317-4c27-be19-8e271d59b695","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:26:06.477Z","thinking_duration_ms":14206}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNcDlFMz6l8phVAVHsVi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Private list: first I need the product-card masters renamed so text overrides can find their targets, then the 01_Home grid rebuilt (all eight cards currently show the same photo and name, and the two per-card old-price badges are wrong), and then 02_Shop built on the corrected card. The rename and rebuild are prerequisites, but they run sequentially inside one script, so I'll do them together and verify with one screenshot."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2133,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":112204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2133}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aeaa83eb-a2d5-49ac-8120-9a0636e2bfb4","uuid":"ca34415f-89b4-41c3-aff8-2f07fed63c1a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:26:08.883Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNcDlFMz6l8phVAVHsVi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01m5cLg1NMLNQaxU9gteSySr","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='15:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Light','Regular','Medium','SemiBold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Poppins',style:s});\nconst hex=h=>{h=h.replace('#','');return{r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};};\nconst solid=(h,o=1)=>({type:'SOLID',color:hex(h),opacity:o});\nconst C={gold:'#B88E2F',ink:'#1A1A1F',body:'#4B4B52',muted:'#9F9F9F',line:'#E7E3DD',cream:'#F9F1E7',soft:'#FAF3EA'};\nconst lib=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='Furniro · Component Library');\nconst mediaPage=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.id==='1:4');\nconst P=n=>lib.findOne(x=>x.type==='COMPONENT'&&x.name==='P_'+n);\nconst I=n=>mediaPage.findOne(x=>x.type==='COMPONENT'&&x.name===n);\nconst B=n=>lib.findOne(x=>x.type==='COMPONENT'&&x.name===n);\nconst cardSet=lib.findOne(n=>n.name==='ProductCard');\nconst badgeSet=lib.findOne(n=>n.name==='Badge');\nconst badgeSale=badgeSet.children.find(c=>c.name==='Type=Sale');\nconst badgeNew=badgeSet.children.find(c=>c.name==='Type=New');\n\n// ---- rename masters ----\nfor(const v of cardSet.children){\n  const ph=v.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name.startsWith('Photo'));\n  if(ph) ph.name='Photo';\n  const info=v.children.find(c=>c.name==='Info');\n  if(info){\n    const infoTexts=info.children.filter(c=>c.type==='TEXT');\n    if(infoTexts[0]) infoTexts[0].name='Name';\n    if(infoTexts[1]) infoTexts[1].name='Desc';\n    const pr=info.children.find(c=>c.name==='PriceRow');\n    if(pr){ const pt=pr.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT'); if(pt) pt.name='Price';\n      const ow=pr.findOne(c=>c.name==='OldWrap'); if(ow){ ow.name='OldPriceWrap'; const ot=ow.findOne(c=>c.type==='TEXT'); if(ot) ot.name='OldPrice'; const rr=ow.findOne(c=>c.type==='RECTANGLE'); if(rr) rr.name='Strike'; } }\n  }\n  const bd=v.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name==='Badge'); if(bd) bd.name='Badge';\n}\nconst products=[\n {name:'Syltherine',desc:'Stylish cafe chair',price:'Rs. 2,500,000.00',old:'Rs. 3,500,000.00',badge:'-30%',photo:'Photo_Product_Syltherine'},\n {name:'Leviosa',desc:'Stylish cafe chair',price:'Rs. 2,500,000.00',old:null,badge:null,photo:'Photo_Product_Leviosa'},\n {name:'Lolito',desc:'Luxury big sofa',price:'Rs. 7,000,000.00',old:'Rs. 14,000,000.00',badge:'-50%',photo:'Photo_Product_Lolito'},\n {name:'Respira',desc:'Outdoor bar table and stool',price:'Rs. 500,000.00',old:null,badge:'New',photo:'Photo_Product_Respira'},\n {name:'Grifo',desc:'Night lamp',price:'Rs. 1,500,000.00',old:null,badge:null,photo:'Photo_Product_Grifo'},\n {name:'Muggo',desc:'Small mug',price:'Rs. 150,000.00',old:null,badge:'New',photo:'Photo_Product_Muggo'},\n {name:'Pingky',desc:'Cute bed set',price:'Rs. 7,000,000.00',old:'Rs. 14,000,000.00',badge:'-50%',photo:'Photo_Product_Pingky'},\n {name:'Potty',desc:'Minimalist flower pot',price:'Rs. 500,000.00',old:null,badge:'New',photo:'Photo_Product_Potty'}\n];\nconst txt=(parent,chars,size,style,color,x,y,o={})=>{ const t=figma.createText(); parent.appendChild(t); t.fontName={family:'Poppins',style}; t.characters=chars; t.fontSize=size; t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh||Math.round(size*1.45)}; if(o.ls) t.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.ls}; t.fills=[solid(color)]; if(o.w){t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';t.resize(o.w,10);} if(o.center) t.textAlignHorizontal='CENTER'; t.x=x;t.y=y; return t; };\nconst tintV=(n,col)=>{ n.fills=[]; (function d(x){ if(x.fills&&['VECTOR','ELLIPSE','RECTANGLE','POLYGON','BOOLEAN_OPERATION'].includes(x.type)) x.fills=[solid(col)]; if('children'in x) x.children.forEach(d); })(n); };\nconst icon=(parent,name,size,color,x,y)=>{ const i=I(name).createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name=name; i.resize(size,size); tintV(i,color); i.x=x;i.y=y; return i; };\nconst photo=(parent,name,x,y,w,h,r)=>{ const c=P(name); const i=c.createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name=name; i.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:c.fills[0].imageHash,scaleMode:'FILL'}]; i.resize(w,h); if(r) i.cornerRadius=r; i.x=x;i.y=y; return i; };\nconst frame=(parent,x,y,w,h,fill,name,r)=>{ const f=figma.createFrame(); parent.appendChild(f); f.name=name||'Frame'; f.resize(w,h); f.fills=fill?[solid(fill)]:[]; if(r) f.cornerRadius=r; f.x=x;f.y=y; return f; };\nconst headerInst=(parent,cur)=>{ const v=lib.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Current='+(cur||'none')); const i=v.createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name='SiteHeader'; i.x=0;i.y=0; return i; };\nconst footerInst=(parent,y)=>{ const i=B('SiteFooter').createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name='SiteFooter'; i.x=0;i.y=y; return i; };\nconst featInst=(parent,y)=>{ const i=B('FeatureStrip').createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name='FeatureStrip'; i.x=0;i.y=y; return i; };\nconst bannerInst=(parent,y,title,current)=>{ const i=B('PageBanner').createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name='PageBanner'; i.x=0;i.y=y;\n  const t=i.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.name==='Title'); if(t) t.characters=title;\n  const cr=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='Breadcrumb');\n  if(cr){ const texts=cr.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); if(texts[0]) texts[0].characters='Home'; if(texts[1]) texts[1].characters=current||title; cr.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG'; cr.x=Math.round((1440-cr.width)/2); }\n  return i; };\nconst btn=(parent,label,style,x,y)=>{ const c=lib.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Style='+style); const i=c.createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name='Button_'+label; const t=i.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); if(t) t.characters=label; i.x=x;i.y=y; return i; };\nconst mkCard=(parent,p,x,y,state)=>{\n  const v=cardSet.children.find(c=>c.name==='State='+(state||'Default'));\n  const i=v.createInstance(); parent.appendChild(i); i.name='ProductCard_'+p.name;\n  const ph=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='Photo'); if(ph){ const c=P(p.photo); ph.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:c.fills[0].imageHash,scaleMode:'FILL'}]; }\n  const nm=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='Name'); if(nm) nm.characters=p.name;\n  const ds=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='Desc'); if(ds) ds.characters=p.desc;\n  const pr=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='Price'); if(pr) pr.characters=p.price;\n  const ow=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='OldPriceWrap'); const ot=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='OldPrice');\n  if(ow&&ot){ if(p.old){ ow.visible=true; ot.characters=p.old; ot.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT'; const w=Math.ceil(ot.width); ow.resize(w+2,26); const st=ow.findOne(n=>n.name==='Strike'); if(st) st.resize(w,1); } else ow.visible=false; }\n  const bd=i.findOne(n=>n.name==='Badge');\n  if(bd){ if(p.badge){ bd.visible=true; bd.swapComponent(p.badge==='New'?badgeNew:badgeSale); const bt=bd.findOne(n=>n.type==='TEXT'); if(bt) bt.characters=p.badge; } else bd.visible=false; }\n  i.x=x;i.y=y; return i;\n};\n\n// ---- rebuild 01_Home grid ----\nconst home=page.findOne(n=>n.name==='01_Home');\nhome.children.filter(c=>c.name.startsWith('ProductCard_')).forEach(c=>c.remove());\nproducts.forEach((p,k)=>{ const r=Math.floor(k/4),c=k%4; mkCard(home,p,100+c*309,1516+r*474,p.name==='Leviosa'?'Hover':'Default'); });\n\n// ---- 02_Shop ----\nconst shop=figma.createFrame(); page.appendChild(shop); shop.name='02_Shop'; shop.resize(1440,3340); shop.fills=[solid('#FFFFFF')]; shop.clipsContent=true; shop.x=1520; shop.y=0;\nheaderInst(shop,'Shop');\nbannerInst(shop,80,'Shop','Shop');\n// toolbar\ntxt(shop,'Showing 1–16 of 32 results',16,'Regular',C.body,100,456,{lh:24});\nconst filterWrap=frame(shop,860,444,200,48,'#FFFFFF','FilterGroup');\nicon(filterWrap,'Icon_Filter',24,C.ink,110,12);\ntxt(filterWrap,'Filter',18,'Regular',C.ink,144,11,{lh:26});\nconst viewWrap=frame(shop,1080,444,120,48,'#FFFFFF','ViewToggle');\nicon(viewWrap,'Icon_Grid',24,C.gold,10,12);\nicon(viewWrap,'Icon_View_List',24,C.muted,5